/www.techinsights.com/blog/introducing-tsmc-n3e-power-behind-apples-m4-soc","line":53},{"title":"Car Thing","target":"https://support.spotify.com/us/article/car-thing-discontinued/","line":69},{"title":"Secure","target":"https://support.google.com/googlenest/answer/10191961?hl=en","line":70},{"title":"Dropcam","target":"https://support.google.com/googlenest/answer/9257288?hl=en&sjid=8920885882621522457-NC","line":70},{"title":"Google shuts down the APIs","target":"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2024/05/google-fit-apis-get-shut-down-in-2025-might-break-fitness-devices/","line":71},{"title":"creates an effective monopoly on repair services","target":"https://nationalaglawcenter.org/update-on-right-to-repair/","line":73},{"title":"over 25% of global marketshare","target":"https://www.nasdaq.com/articles/plowing-ahead:-john-deeres-crop-of-success-in-turbulent-markets","line":73},{"title":"such as banning apps from distribution","target":"https://www.washingtonpost.com/technology/2024/04/19/apple-whatsapp-threads-china/","line":79},{"title":"TikTok does not go forward with a sale to a US-based entity","target":"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c289n8m4j19o","line":81},{"title":"Restricting apps from using NFC communication","target":"https://ec.europa.eu/commission/presscorner/detail/en/ip_22_2764","line":91},{"title":"Limiting APIs that allow iPhones and 3rd-party smartwatches to communicate","target":"https://www.theverge.com/2024/3/22/24107984/apple-watch-smartwatch-ecosystems","line":92},{"title":"Banning alternative browser engines","target":"https://infrequently.org/2022/06/apple-is-not-defending-browser-engine-choice/","line":93}],"metadata":{"title":"right to root access","source":"https://medhir.com/blog/right-to-root-access","author":null,"published":"2001-01-13","created":"2026-03-14","description":"right to repair laws should include provisions requiring manufacturers to unlock a device's bootloader (to provide root access) upon consumer request.","tags":["